**/.ruff_cache/

# JavaScript/frontend dependency and build artifacts
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
dist/
**/dist/
dist-electron/
**/dist-electron/
build/
**/build/
target/
**/target/
out/
**/out/
